<title>USA: Wall Street shares open lower.</title>
<headline>Wall Street shares open lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials and the Nasdaq compasite opened lower on Tuesday, with markets hesitant ahead of the Federal Reserve policy-maker meeting, which could raise short-term U.S. interest rates.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials index was off 25.97 at 7,204.15. The 30-year long bond off 6/32 to yield 6.94 percent.</p>
</text>
